<i>because they produced it.</i>

133
00:18:51,500 --> 00:18:57,250
<i>And they turned the grains of rice into silver.</i>

134
00:19:01,541 --> 00:19:05,625
<i>And then Dargo Sentono's stomach explodes.</i>
<i>Explodes!</i>

135
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:13,291
<i>By his greed. Those rats have become God for Dargo.</i>

136
00:19:13,291 --> 00:19:15,208
