188
00:28:21,583 --> 00:28:24,333
<i>General Amperawan.</i>

189
00:28:25,250 --> 00:28:28,500
<i>Who all have been giving me the honor...</i>

190
00:28:28,750 --> 00:28:32,708
<i>To introduce Batik Mangkujiwo...</i>

191
00:28:33,208 --> 00:28:34,875
<i>To the world.</i>

192
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:50,750
<i>Shouldn't you be at the event?</i>

193
00:30:54,250 --> 00:30:55,458
<i>I want to go to the toilet.</i>

194
00:31:00,666 --> 00:31:01,791
<i>You're lying.</i>

195
00:31:03,583 --> 00:31:04,791
