199
00:31:19,250 --> 00:31:20,583
<i>You're just curious.</i>

200
00:31:24,708 --> 00:31:25,458
<i>So?</i>

201
00:31:33,208 --> 00:31:34,875
<i>The toilet is over there.</i>

202
00:31:43,916 --> 00:31:46,458
<i>This place is no different from slaughtering ground.</i>

203
00:31:46,958 --> 00:31:49,458
<i>There must be tons of spirits haunting this place.</i>

204
00:31:50,041 --> 00:31:52,875
<i>- And I know that you can see those spirits.</i>
<i>- But you don't believe it.</i>

205
00:31:53,500 --> 00:31:55,458
<i>- You just want to make fun of me.</i>
<i>- Maybe...</i>

206
00:31:55,666 --> 00:31:57,541
<i>But you believe what you see.</i>

207
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:00,458
<i>And it's two different things...</i>

208
00:32:01,041 --> 00:32:02,875
<i>Therefore, I believe you.</i>

209
00:32:05,250 --> 00:32:06,000
<i>Nyi Kenanga...</i>

210
00:32:06,375 --> 00:32:07,500
<i>That woman is everywhere...</i>

211
00:32:08,416 --> 00:32:09,541
